  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacity of teaching staff at UNRWA schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT: Improved learning achievements in grades 1-6 in UNRWA schools

OUTPUTS: 
1.	Training of 636 primary school teachers on teaching methodologies for young children in core subjects and as per identified capacity gaps. This training will be developed and implemented by the Universit&#xe9; Saint Joseph (USJ), Beirut.
2.	Enrolment of 62 School Principals in a coaching course on self-care, care of others, and the management of staff and community.
3.	Procurement of additional textbooks for students retained in the UNRWA school system due to changes in its promotion policy.</narrative>
  </description>
